   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 P0 vendor contract + subprocessor list\n\u2022 P0 prompt logs = weaker copy of student data\n\u2022 P1 prompt injection via parent replies\n\u2022 P1 preview + diff, never auto-send\n\u2022 Default the district toggle OFF\n\u2022 Placeholders instead of names",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 P0 vendor contract + subprocessor list\n\u2022 P0 prompt logs = weaker copy of student data\n\u2022 P1 prompt injection via parent replies\n\u2022 P1 preview + diff, never auto-send\n\u2022 Default the district toggle OFF\n\u2022 Placeholders instead of names",
